window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Hayley's on the run from a stalker who's determined to make her pay. When she saves the life of the Alpha of the local wolf pack, exposing her new location in the process, Cooper decides he has to make her his.</p> <p>His to possess, his to love, his to protect.</p> <p>He's waited a long time to find his mate. He's not going to let her go.</p> <p>She risked her cover and her life to save him. He's willing to do anything to keep her alive. </p> <p>This is book 1 in the hot and steamy paranormal werewolf romance series, the Shifters of Grey Ridge.</p>"; 
